        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"sq\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Si të lahen duart</title>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    color: #231f20;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 1000px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px 30px 0 30px;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-size: 94px;\n    line-height: 0.95;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: -2px;\n    margin: 8px 0 10px 0;\n  }\n  h1.title .grey { color: #a7a9ac; }\n  .subtitle {\n    font-size: 21.5px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #a7a9ac;\n    letter-spacing: 0.2px;\n    margin: 0 0 40px 0;\n  }\n  .duration {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n  .clock {\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 40px;\n    background: #808285;\n    color: #fff;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n  .duration .label {\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n  .duration .value {\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #a7a9ac;\n  }\n\n  .grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    column-gap: 32px;\n    row-gap: 34px;\n  }\n  .step { }\n  .figure {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 158px;\n    background: #f1f2f2;\n  }\n  .num {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    background: #808285;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 30px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1;\n    padding: 6px 10px 8px 10px;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #a7a9ac;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    padding: 0 8px;\n  }\n  .caption {\n    font-size: 15.5px;\n    line-height: 1.35;\n    margin-top: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 70px;\n  }\n  .orange-bar {\n    background: #f26522;\n    padding: 22px 0 14px 0;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .emblem.placeholder {\n    width: 70px;\n    height: 62px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n  .ministry {\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n  }\n  .grey-bar {\n    background: #a7a9ac;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    padding: 8px 20px 12px 20px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">Si të <span class=\"grey\">lahen</span> duart</h1>\n  <div class=\"subtitle\">LAJINI DUART KUR TË JENË NDOTUR DUKSHËM! NË TË KUNDËRT, FSHIJINI ATO</div>\n\n  <div class=\"duration\">\n    <div class=\"clock\">🕐</div>\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"label\">Kohëzgjatja e gjithë procedurës:</span>\n      <span class=\"value\">40 – 60 sekonda</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">0</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: hands under running tap over sink]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Lagini duart me ujë;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">1</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: hand under soap dispenser]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Vendosni mjaft sapun që të mbulohet e gjithë sipërfaqja e dorës;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">2</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: palm rubbing palm, circular arrow]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Fërkojini duart pëllëmbë me pëllëmbë;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">3</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: right palm over back of left hand, interlaced fingers, curved arrow]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Pëllëmba e djathtë mbi shpinën e së majtës me gishtat e gërshetuar dhe anasjelltas;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">4</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: palm to palm with fingers interlaced, crossed arrows]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Pëllëmbë me pëllëmbë me gishtat e gërshetuar;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">5</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: backs of fingers against opposing palm, up-down arrows]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Shpinën e gishtave kundër pëllëmbëve me gishtat e gërshetuar;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">6</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: rotational rubbing of left thumb, circular arrow]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Fërkim rrotullues i gishtit të madh të majtë duke e shtrënguar në pëllëmbën e djathtë dhe anasjelltas;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">7</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: rotational rubbing of fingertips in left palm, curved arrow]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Fërkim rrotullues, prapa dhe përpara me gishtat e shtrënguar të dorës së djathtë në pëllëmbën e majtë dhe anasjelltas;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">8</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: rinsing hands under tap]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Shpëlaji duart me ujë;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">9</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: drying hands with single-use towel]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Thaji duart tërësisht me peshqir për një përdorim;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">10</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: using towel to turn off tap]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Përdore peshqirin për ta ndalur rubinetin;</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"step\">\n      <div class=\"figure\">\n        <div class=\"num\">11</div>\n        <div class=\"placeholder\">[Illustration: two clean open hands]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"caption\">Duart tuaja tash janë të sigurta.</div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"orange-bar\">\n    <div class=\"emblem placeholder\">[Emblem: centered, Albanian state coat of arms]</div>\n    <div class=\"ministry\">MINISTRIA E<br>SHËNDETËSISË</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grey-bar\">\n    5 momentet e mia për higjienë të duarve<br>\n    'Bazuar në: 'My 5 moments for Hand Hygiene',<br>\n    URL: http://www.who.int/gpsc/5may/background/5moments/en/index.html © World Health Organization 2009'. Të gjitha të drejtat e rezervuara.'\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
